{"id":"7efc508a5e5ea3ad","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Coslice Category","display":"df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category — ZFC Cat2 Coslice Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category — ZFC Cat2 Coslice Category","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category — ZFC Cat2 Coslice Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,X\\in V\\)</span> (source category, candidate coslice, and distinguished object)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=\\langle O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal S=\\langle O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\rangle\\)</span> unpack their set-coded category data</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2CosliceCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2CosliceCategory}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}coslice\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2CosliceCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e,O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal S=\\langle O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal S)\n\\land X\\in O\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land O_S=\\{\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O\\times M:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=A\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land M_S=\\bigl\\{\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in O_S\\times O_S\\times M:\n\\exists A,B,f,g\\;\\bigl(u=\\langle A,f\\rangle\\land v=\\langle B,g\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{62mm}\\land s(h)=A\\land t(h)=B\\land c(\\langle h,f\\rangle)=g\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in O_S\\;\\forall h\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in M_S\\to\ns_S(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle)=u\\land t_S(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle)=v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O_S\\to\ne_S(\\langle A,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,\\langle A,f\\rangle,e(A)\\rangle\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in O_S\\;\\forall h,k\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in M_S\\land\\langle v,w,k\\rangle\\in M_S\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\to c_S(\\langle\\langle v,w,k\\rangle,\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\rangle)\n=\\langle u,w,c(\\langle k,h\\rangle)\\rangle\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}coslice\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2CosliceCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e,O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal S=\\langle O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal S)\n\\land X\\in O\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land O_S=\\{\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O\\times M:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=A\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land M_S=\\bigl\\{\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in O_S\\times O_S\\times M:\n\\exists A,B,f,g\\;\\bigl(u=\\langle A,f\\rangle\\land v=\\langle B,g\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{62mm}\\land s(h)=A\\land t(h)=B\\land c(\\langle h,f\\rangle)=g\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in O_S\\;\\forall h\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in M_S\\to\ns_S(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle)=u\\land t_S(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle)=v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O_S\\to\ne_S(\\langle A,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,\\langle A,f\\rangle,e(A)\\rangle\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in O_S\\;\\forall h,k\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in M_S\\land\\langle v,w,k\\rangle\\in M_S\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{38mm}\\to c_S(\\langle\\langle v,w,k\\rangle,\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\rangle)\n=\\langle u,w,c(\\langle k,h\\rangle)\\rangle\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both category six-tuples are unpacked inside the assertion. Objects, arrows, source, target, identities, and composition of the coslice are all tied to the corresponding components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>; no selector such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> remains free.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (category predicate, see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S=\\langle O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2CosliceCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}coslice\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2CosliceCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e,O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal S=\\langle O_S,M_S,s_S,t_S,c_S,e_S\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal S)\n\\land X\\in O\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land O_S=\\{\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O\\times M:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=A\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land M_S=\\bigl\\{\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in O_S\\times O_S\\times M:\n\\exists A,B,f,g\\;\\bigl(u=\\langle A,f\\rangle\\land v=\\langle B,g\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{62mm}\\land s(h)=A\\land t(h)=B\\land c(\\langle h,f\\rangle)=g\\bigr)\\bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v\\in O_S\\;\\forall h\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in M_S\\to\ns_S(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle)=u\\land t_S(\\langle u,v,h\\rangle)=v\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O_S\\to\ne_S(\\langle A,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,\\langle A,f\\rangle,e(A)\\rangle\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in O_S\\;\\forall h,k\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\in M_S\\land\\langle v,w,k\\rangle\\in M_S\\\\\n&\\hspace{38mm}\\to c_S(\\langle\\langle v,w,k\\rangle,\\langle u,v,h\\rangle\\rangle)\n=\\langle u,w,c(\\langle k,h\\rangle)\\rangle\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false}],"bytes":2365,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1575","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-coslice-category]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}